DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaaaccrraaiidd driver provides support for the Adaptec by PMC RAID con‐
     trollers, including Series 6/7/8 and upcoming families.

     The RAID containers are handled via the aaaaccrraaiiddpp00 bus.  The physical
     buses are represented by the aaaaccrraaiiddpp?? devices (beginning with
     aacraidp1).  These devices enable the SCSI pass-passthrough interface and
     allows devices connected to the card such as CD-ROMs to be available via
     the CAM scsi(4) subsystem.  Note that not all cards allow this interface
     to be enabled.

     The _/_d_e_v_/_a_a_c_r_a_i_d_? device nodes provide access to the management interface
     of the controller.  One node exists per installed card.  If the
     _a_a_c_r_a_i_d___l_i_n_u_x_._k_o and _l_i_n_u_x_._k_o modules are loaded, the Linux-compatible
     ioctl(2) interface for the management device will be enabled and will al‐
     low Linux-based management applications to control the card.

